{"title":"백로식당","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=8bvp5/hAd4SsJyfU/oIwMkc3BIe9QHWu0BK7920&filename=th3","synopsis":"신들은 어디에나 있다. \n\n요리하는 만신 백로는 \n격변하는 현대사회에 적응해야만 하는 신들에게 \n대가를 받고 신들을 위한 음식을 만든다. \n\n각자의 사정을 싸들고 와서 \n백로의 바짓가랑이를 잡는 각양각색의 신들. \n\n듬직하고 애교많은 산군 호랑이 ‘오택’, \n다정하지만 어딘지 쎄한 흑룡 ‘진’, \n베일 속에 가려진 이무기까지. \n\n연애세포가 죽어버린 백로의 가슴을 자꾸만 두드려대는데….\n\n신화 속 신들이 바로 우리 곁에서, \n살기 위해 발버둥치는 슬프고도 아름다운 이야기.\n\n한국형 신화를 곁들인 로맨스 판타지 한식대첩!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":266,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":281,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":279,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":212,"change":{"type":"up","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":192,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":75}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":274,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":196,"change":{"type":"up","amount":78}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":218,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":192,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":191,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":287,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":270,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":242,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":247,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":211,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":232,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":206,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-22